WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:07.810
I've got a favor.

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:08.750
Favor?

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:12.130
I'm leaving my position as Raimon's coach.

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.340
Kidou.

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.960
Take up the position in my place.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:20.130
What's the meaning of this, Endou?!

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:26.150
Fifth Sector's true goal might not just be the management of soccer.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:27.540
What?

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:32.920
It's not fully clear yet, so I want to investigate.

00:00:33.810 --> 00:00:37.100
Right now, you're the only one I can entrust Raimon to.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.760
Please, Kidou.

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.630
You...

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.480
Everyone, I'm sorry.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:47.910
I'm leaving Raimon.

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:49.360
Why?

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.630
Kidou will be taking over as Raimon's coach.

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:54.120
No way...

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:58.490
Coach!

00:00:58.490 --> 00:00:59.580
Coach!

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:03.070
Coach Endou gave us the courage to fight against Fifth Sector.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:05.780
He was our pillar of support!

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:07.210
Shindou...

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:11.930
We third-years wanted to make the revolution a success with him before we graduated!

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:16.900
I thought we'd get to play real soccer under Coach Endou...

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:19.610
Can't do anything about someone who's not here.

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:21.340
What?

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.680
You think being sad will make him come back?

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:24.670
Tsurugi!

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:25.980
Stop!

00:03:30.120 --> 00:03:32.840
Come on, what's with this atmosphere?

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:34.670
Let's be more lighthearted about this!

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:35.650
Right, Shindou?

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:40.150
C'mon, c'mon, c'mon!

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:42.440
Being depressed doesn't get anyone anywhere!

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:46.540
Birdbrain.

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.770
You haven't grown up at all, Nishiki.

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.160
Neither has that bad habit with your leg, Midori.

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.510
Say that again?!

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:56.490
You've gotten slower!

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:57.630
Why, you...!

00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:58.270
Whoa!

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:02.400
It's Raimon... but it doesn't feel like Raimon.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:08.710
Why me?

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:13.940
I can only see the good things about other people.

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:22.140
So the only choice as coach has to be you, Kidou.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:29.280
I'm changing the training menu as of today.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.600
Coach Endou isn't here after all...

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:51.370
This training menu...

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:53.070
They're not using the ball.

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:56.380
Yeah. This is supposed to be <i>soccer</i>  practice.

00:05:03.570 --> 00:05:04.700
Nishizono!

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:06.430
Raise the bar for your jumping.

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:09.100
Why?

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:11.620
Just me?

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:14.580
Maybe he wants you to quit the soccer club.

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:23.290
Amagi, increase it to three tires.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:34.080
Hamano, change your stand to a ball.

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:44.520
How many laps is it now?

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:47.900
I'm so tired, I don't even know...

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:53.260
I can't run any further...

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:58.620
Amagi-senpai!

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:00.210
Coach!

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:01.650
Keep going!

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:04.890
Okay...

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:11.800
Nii-san...

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:24.290
I can feel the burn....

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:37.090
That'll be all for practice.

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.920
<i>Maybe he wants you to quit the soccer club.</i>

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:47.800
I... don't agree with this...

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:51.250
Is this... how Coach Kidou does things?

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:59.030
What are you trying to do, Nii-san?

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:01.670
That practice will make them all break down one day!

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:03.740
I must make Raimon win.

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:05.740
That's my duty.

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:09.350
Nii-san...

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.420
It's the same as yesterday...

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.280
Coach Kidou.

00:07:32.280 --> 00:07:34.800
Shinsuke-kun has reached his limit.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.970
Has Nishizono said that?

00:07:37.370 --> 00:07:39.020
No, but...

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:40.410
Then continue.

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:51.470
That's all for today.

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:58.920
I can't take this anymore!

00:07:58.920 --> 00:08:01.220
Calm down! It's only the second day.

00:08:01.220 --> 00:08:03.640
It'll be the same thing all over again tomorrow!

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:08.080
I'm not showing up for practice starting tomorrow!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.070
Shinsuke, are you serious?

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:11.930
Yeah!

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:13.860
Neither am I!

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.610
You with us, Kageyama?

00:08:15.610 --> 00:08:18.080
You don't like this kind of training either, right?

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:19.710
Amagi-san!

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.490
Don't try to stop us!

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:25.190
I-I'm... um...!

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:26.700
Shinsuke!

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:31.310
Shinsuke!

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:39.330
I think Coach Kidou has his reasons for making us go through that training.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:42.660
Soccer will teach us about soccer.

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:46.150
I'm sure that what Coach Kidou is thinking will soon come to light, too.

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:48.680
So let's keep trying, okay?

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:49.670
No!

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.840
I've been practicing with everything I've got!

00:08:54.840 --> 00:08:56.810
But Coach Kidou...

00:08:59.210 --> 00:09:03.010
Do you play soccer because you want Coach Kidou to acknowledge you?

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:07.480
It's easy for you to say, Tenma...

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:11.600
You can use an Avatar and Coach Kidou isn't mean to you.

00:09:11.970 --> 00:09:15.180
Someone like you can't understand how I feel!

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:16.320
Shinsuke!

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.500
I have no intention of changing the training menu.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:25.110
Coach Kidou!

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.380
He wouldn't even listen.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.380
The team's going to fall apart at this rate.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:36.510
Coach Endou...

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:41.810
I can't stand working with Coach Kidou anymore!

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:43.790
Here, one bowl of ramen.

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:46.900
Fried rice too? But we just ordered ramen...

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:48.360
It's on the house.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.180
Thank you!

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:55.420
I thought Tenma would at least agree with me...

00:10:04.410 --> 00:10:06.120
What do I do?

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:14.900
I'm the club's counselor.

00:10:14.900 --> 00:10:16.250
I have to protect my players!

00:10:19.420 --> 00:10:21.020
We need to talk, Nii-san.

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:23.660
What are you planning to do with the soccer club?

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:27.440
That's dangerous!

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:30.280
This is...

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.810
Tenma-kun's data?

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.260
Shindou-kun and Kurama-kun...

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:35.790
And Shinsuke-kun...

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.760
The entire team's personal information is here with such detail...

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:43.320
Nii-san...

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:47.910
12.23. Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:46.060 --> 00:10:48.770
Inazuma Eleven GO the Movie: The Ultimate Bonds, Gryphon 
 Opening Day - Friday

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:53.310
12.23. Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.680
Inazuma Eleven GO the Movie: The Ultimate Bonds, Gryphon 
 Opening Day - Friday

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:01.930
I wonder if Shinsuke will be there for morning practice...

00:11:06.150 --> 00:11:07.840
You want to come along, Sasuke?

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:16.150
Well, Sasuke, let's start practice!

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:25.580
Shinsuke...

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.750
He didn't come today...

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:31.010
"Countries may fall, but their rivers and mountains remain".

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:34.150
"When spring comes to the ruined castle, the grass is green again".

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:37.900
"Such emotional times that flowers spill tears".

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:37.900
Should I try talking to him?

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:41.360
"Separation is so troubling that the call of birds stir the soul".

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:41.130
No, I want to talk to him myself.

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:52.120
Three people didn't show up. Wouldn't that make you think there's something wrong with this training?

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:01.180
I can't treat them like Teikoku.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.800
Three bowls of ramen.

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:06.170
Man, I'm so irritated!

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:08.760
I'll just have to transfer!

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:10.240
Right, Kageyama?

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.470
Y-Yes...

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.590
If you don't like it, fight it.

00:12:16.290 --> 00:12:17.870
Fight?

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:18.910
N-Not me...

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:23.910
Come to think of it, we're taking back real soccer from Fifth Sector.

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:26.790
If I run away now, things will go back to the same as before!

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:29.890
Okay, I'll fight!

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:30.510
Right?

00:12:31.420 --> 00:12:33.640
Fight? You don't mean... with Coach?!

00:12:34.430 --> 00:12:36.260
Here, one bowl of ramen.

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:38.050
Free fried rice again!

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:41.150
Now that I've made up my mind, it's time to strengthen myself up!

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:43.490
Let's eat!

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:46.900
Shinsuke, what are you gonna do?

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:50.700
I'm not going back.

00:12:57.570 --> 00:13:02.650
Back then, Coach Endou showed us hope.

00:13:03.490 --> 00:13:04.430
Everyone...

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:06.350
We're just like you.

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:09.220
We felt that Coach Endou would be waiting here for us.

00:13:10.100 --> 00:13:12.900
Geh, am I the only one who doesn't know what's going on?

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:16.010
Coach Endou...

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.340
Why...

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:18.500
Shindou!

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:20.450
Nishiki!

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:24.080
You get way depressed a lot of the time, Shindou.

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.520
Did you infect the rest of these guys with your depression too?

00:13:27.410 --> 00:13:28.720
You don't understand!

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:30.010
Maybe I don't.

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:34.400
But yeah. There is one change about you guys that surprised me.

00:13:34.400 --> 00:13:35.600
What do you think it is?

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:37.320
Nishiki, enough-

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:39.780
The answer is, your faces!

00:13:39.780 --> 00:13:43.880
Compared to back when you'd lost all motivation, you look so alive now it's electric!

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:46.450
I could tell right away...

00:13:46.450 --> 00:13:53.260
That Coach Endou gave light to the seeds sleeping in your hearts and made them sprout.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:55.460
Are you going to let them wither away now?!

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:59.930
I'd never let that happen, if it were up to me!

00:13:59.930 --> 00:14:03.610
I'll make that sprout grow so huge that it'll surprise the heck outta Coach the next time I see him!

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.000
Nishiki...

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:06.540
Just saying.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:18.170
Shinsuke didn't come back home yet.

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:23.210
Do you think he won't show up at practice anymore?

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.350
I'm sure he'll come back.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.110
Then why go all the way to his house?

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:33.210
I wanted to tell him how I felt.

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:35.930
About how much I want to play soccer with him.

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.180
Hello! Rairaiken here!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:48.910
Tobitaka!

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:51.730
One bowl of nosiness.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.780
Kidou-san.

00:14:54.780 --> 00:15:01.350
Back when we aimed to be the world's best, I worried about standing on the same field as the amazing people around me.

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:05.030
I wasn't confident that I could keep pace with everyone else.

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:08.070
It's hard to see the people who walk in front of you.

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:09.950
Because they're so bright.

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:14.460
Am I that person walking in front of them right now?

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.280
Eat up before it gets cold.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.600
Tobitaka...

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:27.010
Even though I told you that, I'm sure you already know.

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:31.120
You, who knows what's different between Raimon and Teikoku.

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:34.360
Let's eat.

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:55.600
Shin-sama and the others are late...

00:15:55.910 --> 00:15:58.870
Maybe they're skipping. Can't blame them with a coach like that.

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:08.100
No matter how hard the training is, it's nothing compared to the pain of not playing soccer!

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:12.620
Coach Endou helped sprout the buds of revolution in our hearts.

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:15.890
But it's up to us to keep them growing strong!

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:17.260
Right!

00:16:17.260 --> 00:16:19.330
We'll raise them into giants and surprise him!

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:20.500
Yes!

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:25.930
I'll fight! I'll fight! I'll fight!

00:16:26.180 --> 00:16:27.190
Fight?

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:32.200
I'll finish everything that's on the training menu and show Coach Kidou what's what!

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:33.460
Right, Kageyama?

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:34.790
Y-Yes...

00:16:36.960 --> 00:16:40.740
Thank goodness... I thought he was going to fight with Coach Kidou...

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:44.480
Now the only one left is Shinsuke...

00:16:44.990 --> 00:16:47.360
Shinsuke will come! I know he will!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:50.150
But from how he was acting...

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:52.520
I believe in him!

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:03.350
Tenma!

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:04.890
Shinsuke!

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:06.240
I...

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:09.330
I want to play soccer with you, too!

00:17:09.700 --> 00:17:10.370
Yeah!

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:12.510
I love soccer!

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:16.880
And when I play with Tenma and the others, I love it even more!

00:17:16.880 --> 00:17:19.010
That's why I won't run from soccer!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.510
Or from Coach Kidou!

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:27.870
I'm not running anymore!

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:31.880
You have a new training menu today.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.890
The menu you're holding is meant solely for you.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:38.190
There's more categories than ever before.

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:41.080
The count for some of them has gone down, though, but...

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.310
It's going to be rough.

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:50.140
Coach Kidou, when we've cleared our training, can we all have a talk?

00:17:50.140 --> 00:17:52.860
We want to discuss what to do with Raimon's soccer club from here on.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:57.590
I'm not good at running!

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.010
Or at sit-ups!

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:02.800
But we'll finish them all!

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:08.730
All done!

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.570
I finished the entire training menu!

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:13.020
Us too...

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.200
Last one!

00:18:19.370 --> 00:18:20.760
It's over!

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:22.500
The only one left...

00:18:25.020 --> 00:18:26.670
One more to go.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:38.380
I won't give up!

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:43.910
I love soccer!

00:18:44.770 --> 00:18:46.090
You can do it, Shinsuke!

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:48.840
With the others...

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.790
Yes!

00:18:53.140 --> 00:18:53.830
He did it!

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:55.070
All right!

00:18:55.310 --> 00:18:57.310
We all made it!

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:04.740
He's probably so humiliated that he can't even speak.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:05.980
Is that really?

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:12.050
I see.

00:19:12.640 --> 00:19:13.780
Tsurugi?

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:19.580
The new training menu contains just enough so that we're able to finish it all.

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:23.800
I see... If he was able to make a menu like that...

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:28.120
Coach Kidou has a good understanding of our individual abilities.

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:33.730
It might seem like he's asking impossible things from us at first, but it's meant to bring out the greatest extent of each of our powers.

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:36.370
What an unbelievable person...

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:43.030
So that difficult training was to research our individual limits and make training menus that suited us?

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:46.610
Is that true?

00:19:48.340 --> 00:19:53.500
Raimon's strengths are your hissatsu techniques and your specialty plays.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.610
Your weakness is basic physical power.

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:57.330
Basic physical power?

00:19:57.700 --> 00:20:04.730
Muscle strength, force, and stamina are the basic foundations of physical strength.

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:08.510
It isn't good to depend too much on your hissatsu techniques and plays.

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:10.840
Sometimes, they just won't work.

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:14.850
What is most helpful during those times is your basic physical power.

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:19.940
<i>I can only see the good things about other people.</i>

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:26.410
<i>So the only choice as coach has to be you, Kidou.</i>

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:30.510
You realized it too, Endou.

00:20:30.510 --> 00:20:33.150
About what was needed to be done to make Raimon stronger.

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:36.430
Then the reason you were so harsh on me in particular...

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:42.090
You tend to decide your own limits without testing them fully.

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:43.620
But you realize that now.

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:44.590
Yes, sir!

00:20:45.150 --> 00:20:47.670
Thank you, Coach.

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:50.230
Once again, it's good to be working with you.

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:54.110
Please take good care of us!

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.260
Tenma!

00:21:06.230 --> 00:21:06.920
Shinsuke!

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:08.700
Tenma, pass!

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:09.880
Okay!

00:21:13.140 --> 00:21:13.940
I'm sorry.

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:15.910
Did you say something?

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:17.390
No, nothing!

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:24.420
Here I go, Tenma!

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:56.560
Nishiki-senpai officially joins and Raimon accelerates!

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.840
But the coach for our next opponent, Kidokawa Seishuu, is...

00:22:59.840 --> 00:23:04.430
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 The Fated Confrontation! Kidokawa Seishuu!!

00:23:04.430 --> 00:23:06.200
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.820
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.180 --> 00:23:25.840
Soccer will teach us about soccer.

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:26.930
That's all!
